@startuml
actor Patient
participant Gateway
participant "Clinic Service" as Clinic
database PostgreSQL as DB
queue RabbitMQ as MQ
participant Notification
Patient -> Gateway: POST /recommendations
Gateway -> Clinic: authenticated request
Clinic -> DB: work schedules + leave + bookings
Clinic --> Patient: ranked slots + reasons
Patient -> Gateway: POST /appointments + Idempotency-Key
Gateway -> Clinic: booking command
Clinic -> DB: BEGIN + lock/check + INSERT
alt conflict
  DB --> Clinic: exclusion violation
  Clinic --> Patient: 409 SLOT_CONFLICT
else reserved
  Clinic -> MQ: AppointmentCreated (outbox)
  Clinic --> Patient: 201 PENDING
  MQ -> Notification: email confirmation request
end
@enduml

